  "policy_quote": "Before taking any action that updates the database (cancel, modify, return, exchange), you must list the action details and obtain explicit user confirmation (yes) to proceed. You should not make up any information or knowledge or procedures not provided by the user or the tools, or give subjective recommendations or comments. You should at most make one tool call at a time, and if you take a tool call, you should not respond to the user at the same time. You should deny user requests that are against this policy.",

